cratch.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, that poor unborn game. To write more of the plans I had for It and post them here is in my list of things to do. It's part of my way to deal with grief<br /> <br /> I'm away from home and can't write much, but here's another who supports the &quot;connections between the GM are Hinduism are blatant or easy to make, plus the way that Storyteller placed himself regards the topic does not make for good premises&quot; side<br /> <br /> In a couple of days I'll write a proper rant. I doubt I'd be able to run a game right now, but I strongly disagree with what that ST thinks about Demon and saying why other people are wrong on the Internet always has its charm","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 04-14-2018, 02:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T11:54:49-07:00","id":1206972,"title":"","content":"Its funny (incomprehensible) to see that a person argued that God Machine stuff HAS to be Judaeo-Christian angel and demon stuff only when I have a friend and acquaintance whose problem with it is th